  "idea": "Stripe Billing 2.0 updates for metered usage and automated tax",
  "text": "Stripe just revamped their billing engine for software and agency subscriptions. Founders lose thousands of dollars monthly trying to track seat upgrades, overage charges, and foreign sales tax manually. Custom database scripts for usage billing fail under high request volume, causing incorrect customer charges. Stripe Billing aggregates consumption events in real time and automatically calculates jurisdiction-specific taxes at checkout. This eliminates billing leakage and saves engineering time.",
